---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HomeLoanForeclosurePlanner from '../../components/calculators/HomeLoanForeclosurePlanner';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Home Loan Foreclosure Planner | SIP vs Home Loan Calculator | Ant Wealth Creation"
  description="See how a SIP alongside your EMI could help you plan for an earlier home-loan closure."
  canonicalUrl="https://antwealth.in/tools/home-loan-foreclosure"
>
  <main class="foreclosure-page-main">
    <!-- Breadcrumb Navigation -->
    <div class="breadcrumb-container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-nav" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/" class="breadcrumb-link">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span>
        <a href="/tools" class="breadcrumb-link">Calculators</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span>
        <span class="breadcrumb-current">Home Loan Foreclosure Planner</span>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <header class="foreclosure-header-section">
      <div class="foreclosure-header-inner">
        <div class="foreclosure-badge">Home Loan + SIP Optimization</div>
        <h1 class="foreclosure-main-title">Home Loan Foreclosure Planner</h1>
        <p class="foreclosure-main-subtitle">
          See how a SIP alongside your EMI could help you plan for an earlier home-loan closure.
        </p>

        <!-- Trust Badges Row -->
        <div class="trust-perks-row">
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">🔒</span>
            <span class="perk-text">100% Confidential</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">🛡️</span>
            <span class="perk-text">No Forced Lead Capture</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">⚖️</span>
            <span class="perk-text">EMI + SIP Analysis</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">📊</span>
            <span class="perk-text">Monthly Loan Simulation</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Interactive Calculator Island -->
    <section class="calculator-container" aria-label="Interactive Home Loan Foreclosure Planner">
      <HomeLoanForeclosurePlanner client:load />
    </section>

    <!-- Educational Guide Section -->
    <section class="edu-guide-section" aria-labelledby="edu-heading">
      <div class="edu-inner">
        <div class="edu-badge">Educational Guide</div>
        <h2 id="edu-heading" class="edu-title">How a SIP Can Help You Plan an Earlier Home Loan Closure</h2>
        <p class="edu-intro">
          When taking a long-term home loan, families often debate between prepaying the principal directly or investing surplus cash into mutual fund SIPs. Here is how parallel wealth accumulation works.
        </p>

        <div class="edu-grid">
          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">📉</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">1. EMI Reduces Loan Balance</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              Your monthly EMI continues paying down your home loan every single month. In the early years, interest dominates the payment, but principal repayment accelerates over time.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">📈</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">2. Parallel SIP Builds a Corpus</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              By investing an affordable surplus amount into a mutual fund SIP alongside your EMI, your investments compound at market-linked returns while remaining 100% liquid under your control.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">🎯</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">3. The Crossover Point</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              Because your outstanding loan decreases every month while your SIP corpus grows exponentially, there comes a milestone month where your SIP corpus equals or exceeds your remaining loan balance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">⚖️</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">4. Flexibility & Discretion</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              Reaching the crossover point gives you total flexibility: you can choose to fully foreclose your home loan debt-free, or keep the investment corpus growing for your retirement and other life goals.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Cross-Discovery Navigation -->
    <section class="cross-discovery-section" aria-labelledby="tools-heading">
      <div class="cross-inner">
        <h2 id="tools-heading" class="cross-title">Explore Other Financial Planning Suites</h2>
        <p class="cross-subtitle">Discover comprehensive, privacy-first planning tools designed for Indian families.</p>

        <div class="cross-grid">
          <a href="/tools/home-purchase" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🏠</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Home Purchase Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Plan property appreciation, down payment, acquisition costs, and monthly EMI affordability.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/sip-growth" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🚀</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">SIP Growth Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">See how monthly SIPs, annual step-ups, and multiple lump-sum investments compound over time.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/swp" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">📉</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">SWP Calculator</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Simulate monthly retirement withdrawals, annual step-ups, and test corpus sustainability.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/retirement" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🌅</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Retirement Accumulation Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Calculate how much corpus you need to save before retirement and your monthly SIP roadmap.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/retirement-distribution" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">⏳</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Retirement Distribution Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Structure your post-retirement corpus across liquidity, safety, and wealth creation buckets.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/life-insurance" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🛡️</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Life Insurance Need Analysis</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Calculate your family's true term insurance protection gap factoring living expenses and debts.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/plan/children" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🎓</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Children's Future Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Map graduation, post-graduation, and marriage milestones with inflation and step-up SIPs.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/health-check/real-statement" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">💎</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">REAL Financial Statement</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Audit your income, living costs, ongoing savings, and calculate your true family net worth.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .foreclosure-page-main {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background-color: #F8FAFC;
    color: #00182A;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb-container {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 0.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb-link {
    color: #64748B;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .breadcrumb-link:hover {
    color: #00AB96;
  }

  .breadcrumb-sep {
    color: #94A3B8;
  }

  .breadcrumb-current {
    color: #00182A;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Header Section */
  .foreclosure-header-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00182A 0%, #002B49 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .foreclosure-header-inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .foreclosure-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(0, 171, 150, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 171, 150, 0.4);
    color: #00AB96;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .foreclosure-main-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .foreclosure-main-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #CBD5E1;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem 0;
  }

  .trust-perks-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .trust-perk {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #E2E8F0;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .perk-icon {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* Calculator Container */
  .calculator-container {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Educational Guide Section */
  .edu-guide-section {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .edu-inner {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .edu-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #00AB96;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .edu-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .edu-intro {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .edu-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .edu-card {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  .edu-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .edu-card-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .edu-card-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Cross Discovery */
  .cross-discovery-section {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .cross-inner {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cross-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .cross-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #64748B;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
  }

  .cross-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .cross-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1.5px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cross-card:hover {
    border-color: #00AB96;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .cross-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cross-info {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .cross-card-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
  }

  .cross-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #64748B;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .cross-arrow {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #00AB96;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .cross-card:hover .cross-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .foreclosure-main-title {
      font-size: 1.85rem;
    }
    .foreclosure-header-section {
      padding: 2.25rem 1rem 2rem;
    }
    .trust-perks-row {
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .edu-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .cross-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
